        "body": "The Department of Homeland Security is the top buyer with $168M in FY2027 to date. The Department of Veterans Affairs is the second largest buyer with $23.9M. The Department of Labor follows with $7.5M, and the General Services Administration follows with $3.7M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the largest contractors and which industries dominate obligations?",
        "body": "WHITING-TURNER CONTRACTING COMPANY, THE is the largest contractor with $155M in obligations. CONTINUUM OF CARE INC is the second largest contractor with $6.6M, and SIKORSKY AIRCRAFT CORPORATION is the third with $6M. Commercial and Institutional Building Construction is the largest industry with $160M, followed by Other Technical and Trade Schools with $7.5M."
      }
    ]
